  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.27: themed PDF output now matches asciidoctor-pdf. With an asciidoctor-pdf YAML theme and embedded fonts, AdocNet draws the title page (background, logo, title/subtitle, authors, revision), uses Prawn line metrics, kerning and the default theme fallbacks, places headers and footers and numbers pages like asciidoctor-pdf (running content after the TOC), and lays out the TOC, tables (prawn-table geometry, column percentages, repeated header), admonitions, lists and code blocks the same way. Also: unique ids for sections with the same title (TOC and xref page numbers), percentage column widths, hard line breaks in PDF paragraphs, per-level heading fonts, and PdfThemeLoader.Load(theme, fontsDir, baseDirectory). See CHANGELOG.md.",
